<h2>Your Inquiry Has Been Resolved</h2>

<p>Dear <%= memberName %>,</p>

<p>We're pleased to let you know that your inquiry has been reviewed and resolved by our support team.</p>

<div style="background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 20px 0;">
  <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Resolution Details</h3>
  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
    <% if (inquiryTitle) { %>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><strong>Inquiry:</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><%= inquiryTitle %></td>
    </tr>
    <% } %>
    <% if (resolvedBy) { %>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><strong>Resolved By:</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><%= resolvedBy %></td>
    </tr>
    <% } %>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><strong>Resolved On:</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;"><%= resolvedDate || new Date().toLocaleString() %></td>
    </tr>
    <% if (resolutionNote) { %>
    <tr>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0; vertical-align: top;"><strong>Resolution Note:</strong></td>
      <td style="padding: 8px 0;"><%= resolutionNote %></td>
    </tr>
    <% } %>
  </table>
</div>

<p>We hope this resolves your concern. If you have any further questions or need additional support, please feel free to contact us at <a href="mailto:<%= franchise.supportEmail %>"><%= franchise.supportEmail %></a>.</p>

<p>Thank you for being a valued member of the <%= franchise.franchiseName %> community.</p>

<p>Best regards,<br>The <%= franchise.franchiseName %> Team</p>
